    {
      "text": "We got $LITE, $MTSI, $AAOI all pointing to extreme demand imbalances with lasers/TIA/DSP/etc from earnings... \n\nAnd now Elazr GM at their investor conference stated: \n\nOptical supply is still far behind the market demand, the expected AI optical supply chain are likely to https://t.co/tl3Uh6ZBpD",
