      ],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Unitree (688836) is now public.\n\nAnd is valued at ~$53.3B, after rising +492.18%\n\nWe finally have a major public company benchmark for humanoids.\n\nFor reference, Agility (backed by $NVDA, $AMZN) via $CCXI is expected to go public at $2.5B premoney valuation Q4. \n\n$TSLA is $1T+, https://t.co/hcK1MIDVkq",
