    {
      "text": "So just tracking the MLCC cycle:\n\nComponentNews classified server MLCCs as “severe” shortage stage, with ETNews reporting:\n\n- Samsung has reached ~40 week lead times for some high capacitance MLCCs per DigiKey’s shipment data.\n\nEarlier this year, broader reports were ~20 weeks, https://t.co/T5x9aKArog",
